                    + KT-47 (timer SBI) + KT-49 (SMP 15..19) + KT-50 (IPI 20..24) + KT-51 (TLB/ASID
                    25..29) + KT-52 (object layer 30..36) + KT-55 (conformance 5 `.scn` 37:
